# @creit.tech/stellar-wallets-kit depends on @hot-wallet/sdk -> @wallet-standard/features,
# which declares engines.node >=22. We don't use the HOT wallet module (it's unrelated to
# Stellar), but yarn still installs the whole package's dependency tree and fails the
# engine check on older Node versions. Ignore engine checks project-wide rather than
# pin around one irrelevant transitive dependency.
ignore-engines true
